{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120112731699-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120115528\"/><p>天文台在今日（20日）上午11時15分發出寒冷天氣警告。預測本港今明兩日天氣寒冷。日間市區最低氣溫約在攝氏12度左右，新界及高地會再低一兩度。</p><p>市民應注意保暖，多穿禦寒衣物，並應保持室內空氣流通。由於高地風勢頗大，風寒效應明顯，身體感覺的溫度比實際氣溫要低，長時間在寒風中有機會導致體溫過低。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:03:52.276955+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:27:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T03:57:24.583239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T03:57:24.583239+00:00","content_hash":"7820b4a78ea0961847957f517ce36be574fc742f10548b50367fcd3c791102ae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}